---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="About" description="About Tease" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main class="fade-up">

    <!-- Row: Full Width Background Image -->
    <div class="w-screen relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw]" style="height: 5em;">
      <img
        src="/images/20260608 tease blog banners tea kettle pour.png"
        alt=""
        class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>

      <!-- Row: Text -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-center">
        <h1>Our Promise:</h1>
        <p>Every tea in our collection made us stop mid-sip and take notes. If it doesn’t make us obsessed, it doesn’t go to your table.
          We cultivate relationships with generational growers who obsess over their craft the way we obsess over ours, and bring back only what genuinely moved us.
          If it didn’t seduce us first, it won’t reach your door.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Row: Image Left / Text Right -->
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 px-6 py-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <img src="/images/mens-hoodie.png" alt="Our Story" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <h2>How It Works:</h2>
          <p>Every month, we will issue a newsletter featuring access to events and this seasons’ tea selection.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Row: Text Left / Image Right -->
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-8 px-6 py-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <img src="/images/womens-v-neck-shirt.png" alt="How It Works" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <h2>Teas That Move You</h2>
          <p>Our mission is simple: connecting 100 tea lovers with exclusive opportunities to sip and savor premium flavors in an intimate setting.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>